===Alternative forms===
* {{qualifier|Ijekavian}}: {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|пје̏сма}}

===Etymology===
From earlier *{{m|sh|sc=Cyrl||pěsma}}, by assimilation p-n → p-m from {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{m|sla-pro|*pěsnь}}. The original stem has been preserved in archaic {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|pjȅsan}} as well as old derivations such as {{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|пје̏снӣк}}/{{m|sh|sc=Cyrl|пе̏снӣк}}.

